---
/**
 * Engineering process (Steps S3.29–S3.43)
 * Section shell, heading block, desktop timeline, and mobile milestone stack.
 */
---

<section class="w-full py-16 sm:py-24 bg-surface-container-lowest">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-md bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
        Methodical Rigor
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-md sm:text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight">
        Our Engineering &amp; Delivery Process
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-secondary mt-2">
        From schematic conception to live energization, our six-phase methodology ensures zero regulatory surprises, complete safety compliance, and robust lifecycle performance.
      </p>
    </div>
    <!-- Desktop Process Flow (Horizontal Chain) -->
    <div class="hidden lg:grid lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4 relative">
      <!-- Connecting Line Background -->
      <div class="absolute top-7 left-8 right-8 h-0.5 bg-surface-container -z-0"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
